span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">mydata </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> specifyModel</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">file </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;model.spec&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span></code></pre></div><div>where model.spec contains the model specifications?</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
